'''Benjamin "Ben" Kirby Tennyson''', is an alternate version of [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|Ben]] from [[Dimension 12041.5]].

==Appearance==
His appearance is exactly the same as the [[Dimension 27998.3]] [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|version]], with the difference being that the design of his [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]] is different, looking exactly the same as season 4, except the white tubes face the left side and have a black square.
