File:Screenshot (1234) - Copy.png|Ben with the [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]]
</gallery>

==Personality==
Closely the same as his Dimension 27998.3 counterpart.

==History==
===Background===
When he was 10 years old, Ben went on summer vacation with his grandfather [[Max Tennyson (Dimension 12041.5)|Max]], but his cousin, Gwen, didn't go on vacation to dedicate herself to her studies. On his summer vacation, Ben found the [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]] and the [[Omnitrix Key]].

===Ben 10===
In ''[[Alien X-Tinction]]'', Ben and Max were camping when they are suddenly attacked by [[Alien X (Reboot)|Alien X]] and he takes Ben's Omnitrix. [[Maximilian Tennyson|Maximilian]] arrives after the villain, and seeing that he was late, he repairs the mess made by Alien X and tells Ben that he may never get his Omnitrix back.

== Powers and Abilities==
===Equipment===
Ben possesses the [[Omnitrix (Reboot)|Omnitrix]]. Through it, he can transform into various aliens and utilize their respective powers.

